  },
  {
   "kind": "fact",
   "text": "Payment mix accounts for {E2.mix_total} of the change, while rates within each method moved {E2.rate_total}: UPI's share rose from {E2.UPI_share0} to {E2.UPI_share1} and its success rate rose from {E2.UPI_rate0} to {E2.UPI_rate1}.",
